ADR refs      : ADR-002, ADR-004, ADR-005, ADR-006, ADR-011, ADR-013, ADR-014, ADR-015

Architecture  : stateless @Composable screen (GeofencesPage / GeofencesPageContent) driven by a
                Hilt-free AndroidX ViewModel (GeofencesPageViewModel : BaseFeedViewModel) that binds
                the shared KMP core (ADR-004) via the GeofencesPageSource seam:
                  useGeofences          -> LocationRepository.geofences()            (cache-then-network Resource)
                  useVehicles           -> VehiclesRepository.vehicles()             (cache-then-network Resource)
                  usePinned('geofence') -> PinnedRepository.pinned(Geofence)         (pinned-first ordering)
                  useBulkGeofencesDelete-> LocationRepository.bulkDeleteGeofences()  (POST /geofences/bulk)
                  create/update         -> ApiHttpClient.safeRequest (shared resilient client, JsonObject body)
                Every panel is a Material 3 Surface/Card (GlassPanel/MetricCard); maps use the A3
                Maps-Compose wrapper (components.maps.GeofenceDrawer -> TeslaMap + MapStyleId.Dark);
                every string resolves from res/values via stringResource (ADR-014). SI values
                (radius m, coordinate degrees) are display-formatted only at the render boundary.

